repository, authored by TecNM Campus Tijuana (2026).

Chapters 1–11 are a digital transcription and modernization of the book
"Problemas para Resolver por Computadora" by Donald D. Spencer, published
by Editorial Limusa (1985). All rights to that original content belong to
Editorial Limusa / Hayden Book Company. The transcription is made available
here solely for educational, non-commercial purposes.

